1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:06,032
Forty-five years of NASA weather. One field. Its first frost now comes eight days later.

2
00:00:06,632 --> 00:00:10,534
So what do you plant? Each morning, Terrasight says what to do first.

3
00:00:11,832 --> 00:00:16,053
Each rotation faces a hundred and fifty weather runs and ten price scenarios.

4
00:00:17,032 --> 00:00:20,933
Ask why. Every number in the answer is checked against the models.

5
00:00:21,533 --> 00:00:24,260
And the models are checked against what really happened.

6
00:00:24,933 --> 00:00:26,746
The owner decides in one tap.

7
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:30,703
From NASA data to tomorrow’s decision.
